      <section class="tg-part" id="part-3" aria-labelledby="part-3-h">
        <div class="tg-part__head">
          <span class="tg-part__kicker">Part III</span>
          <h2 class="tg-part__title" id="part-3-h">The Historical Record, in Order</h2>
          <p class="tg-part__intro">What follows is chronological, quoted from primary
          sources, and deliberately includes the episodes that cut against this study's own
          conclusion. Where a text is famously disputed, the dispute is described rather
          than resolved by fiat. Full citations are on the <a href="#sources">Sources</a>
          tab.</p>
        </div>

